label story_05_complete (The Door Beneath Veld Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The door beneath Veld has answered. I felt the Devourer pressing its name through the stone — heavy, patient, and older than the ruins themselves.
"Dianthus Core": There is no lesser herald between us and that hunger now. The path bends straight toward the bloom or the breach. There is no third road.
"Dianthus Core": My pollen is no longer only a blessing. It is a key, a blade-edge, and the last seed of a strength I have kept hidden since before you found me.
"Dianthus Core": Harvest it when the light steadies. Forge something worthy of the final bloom. This is what I have been saving, little alchemist — and I am giving it to you.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_06_pollen"]
[end_timeline]
